name: ['Abundant Harvest', 'Adventurous Impulse', 'Agonizing Remorse', 'Approach of the Second Sun', "Blue Sun's Zenith", 'Brainstorm', 'Channel', 'Chaos Warp', 'Claim the Firstborn', 'Compulsive Research', 'Counterspell', 'Crux of Fate', 'Cultivate', 'Dark Ritual', 'Day of Judgment', 'Defiant Strike', 'Demonic Tutor', 'Despark', 'Divine Gambit', 'Doom Blade', 'Duress', 'Electrolyze', 'Eliminate', 'Ephemerate', 'Faithless Looting', 'Gift of Estates', 'Gods Willing', 'Grapeshot', 'Growth Spiral', 'Harmonize', 'Increasing Vengeance', 'Infuriate', 'Inquisition of Kozilek', 'Krosan Grip', 'Lightning Bolt', 'Lightning Helix', 'Mana Tithe', 'Memory Lapse', "Mind's Desire", "Mizzix's Mastery", 'Natural Order', 'Negate', 'Opt', 'Primal Command', 'Putrefy', 'Regrowth', 'Revitalize', 'Shock', 'Sign in Blood', 'Snakeskin Veil', 'Stone Rain', 'Strategic Planning', 'Swords to Plowshares', 'Tainted Pact', "Teferi's Protection", 'Tendrils of Agony', "Tezzeret's Gambit", 'Thrill of Possibility', 'Time Warp', "Urza's Rage", 'Village Rites', 'Weather the Storm', 'Whirlwind Denial']
